---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---
<BaseLayout title="Capabilities & Collaboration — POYARA" description="Interactive 3D, AI-native product prototyping and scientific visualization from an independent founder-led studio.">
  <section class="page-header wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">CAPABILITIES / 03</p>
    <h1>From difficult ideas<br />to <em>clear experiences.</em></h1>
    <p>POYARA works where visual understanding, interaction design and software meet. Engagements begin with a specific problem and an output that can be examined.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="capability-grid">
      <article><span class="eyebrow">01 / INTERACTION</span><h2>Interactive 3D & real-time experiences</h2><p>Inspectable equipment demos, interactive product presentations and spatial visualization using real-time 3D technologies. Useful when a static image cannot explain structure, scale or behavior.</p><p class="capability-deliverable">Possible output: a navigable web or real-time prototype.</p></article>
      <article><span class="eyebrow">02 / SOFTWARE</span><h2>AI-native product prototypes</h2><p>Focused experiments that turn a specific user problem into a testable interface and working flow. AI-assisted development accelerates iteration; the product logic still requires deliberate design.</p><p class="capability-deliverable">Possible output: an interactive proof of concept with defined test goals.</p></article>
      <article><span class="eyebrow">03 / EXPLANATION</span><h2>Scientific & technical visualization</h2><p>3D animation and explanatory visual systems shaped by experience in medical and scientific production. Useful for communicating processes or mechanisms that are difficult to film or photograph.</p><p class="capability-deliverable">Possible output: a visual sequence, model or explanatory interactive scene.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="case-grid collaboration-grid">
      <div class="case-main">
        <h2>Collaboration starts with a defined question.</h2>
        <p class="body-large">A useful first brief includes the audience, what they need to understand or accomplish, any technical constraints, and what would count as a successful first test. The outcome might be a technical demonstration, an exploratory prototype or a focused visualization project.</p>
        <div class="inline-actions"><a class="text-link" href={withBase('work/')}>See public evidence <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={withBase('contact/')}>Contact the studio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <aside class="case-meta"><p class="eyebrow">WORKING BOUNDARIES</p><div><span>Scope</span><strong>Defined around a useful deliverable</strong></div><div><span>Process</span><strong>Prototype · Review · Iterate</strong></div><div><span>Claims</span><strong>Evidence before outcomes</strong></div></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
